                            when="1919-10-16T16:00:00+01:39"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                                1919—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:45
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>467. Reported Petrograd and Cronstadt taken.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Haynes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
